flowchart TD
    A[Set left and right pointers] --> B{left less than or equal to right}
    B -- No --> C[Return -1]
    B -- Yes --> D[Compute mid]
    D --> E{nums at mid equals target}
    E -- Yes --> F[Return mid]
    E -- No --> G{Left half is sorted}
    G -- Yes --> H{Target in left half range}
    H -- Yes --> I[Search left half]
    H -- No --> J[Search right half]
    G -- No --> K{Target in right half range}
    K -- Yes --> J
    K -- No --> I
    I --> B
    J --> B

